1) there is only one var-extraction order in analysis (tempadv - locadv - 
sentadv), correlated with the actual surface order of the vars (which is locadv 
- tempadv (sentadv is only in leftdislocrel for the moment), so there is right 
to left extraction)\\
2) in generation, there are more orders possible for insertion (depending on 
source language)\\
3) the surface order for elements of the same 
class remains the same over languages, with obligatory left to right insertion 
(locadv1 - locadv2 - locadv3 etc) = right to left extraction
